### QR Codes APIs Test

### 1. Get Activation Codes with QR Codes (Teacher)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/course/my-activation-codes?course_id=8
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TEACHER_TOKEN

### 2. Get All Activation Codes with QR Codes (Teacher)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/course/my-activation-codes
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TEACHER_TOKEN

### 3. Scan QR Code and Activate Course (Student)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/course/scan-qr-activate
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_STUDENT_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "qr_data": "{\"type\":\"activation_code\",\"code\":\"A1B2C3D4\",\"course_id\":8,\"expires_at\":\"2024-12-31T23:59:59Z\",\"created_at\":\"2024-01-15T10:30:00Z\"}"
}

### 4. Test with Invalid QR Data
POST http://localhost:8000/api/course/scan-qr-activate
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_STUDENT_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "qr_data": "invalid_qr_data"
}

### 5. Test with Expired QR Code
POST http://localhost:8000/api/course/scan-qr-activate
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_STUDENT_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "qr_data": "{\"type\":\"activation_code\",\"code\":\"A1B2C3D4\",\"course_id\":8,\"expires_at\":\"2020-12-31T23:59:59Z\",\"created_at\":\"2020-01-15T10:30:00Z\"}"
}

### 6. Test with Missing QR Data
POST http://localhost:8000/api/course/scan-qr-activate
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_STUDENT_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "invalid_field": "test"
}


